  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.4 — Plugin-store polish: implements IGitHubPlugin (View on GitHub button on the tile), IHelpPlugin (? button → plugin README), INoConnectionRequired (no Dataverse connection prompt — the plugin uses tenant-level MSAL, not the host's IOrganizationService). Ships a dedicated plugin-focused README so the nuget.org / plugin-store landing page no longer pitches the standalone WPF app. New ISSUE_TEMPLATE + CONTRIBUTING.md in the repo. v1.0.3 — Catalog cleanup: corrected 5 BAP routes proven 404 by tenant-side verification. \"Get environment\" now uses /scopes/admin/ prefix (bare path 404s for tenant-admin callers). \"List backups\" BAP duplicate removed (PPAC equivalent works). \"Get tenant settings\" switched from GET to POST {} — listTenantSettings is an ARM-style list-action verb. \"Update tenant settings\" /scopes/admin/ prefix dropped. \"Get DLP policy\" documented (URL is correct, test-rig seed mismatch). v1.0.2 — Initial XrmToolBox store release. Search executes on Enter (not per-keystroke). FluentStyles theme pass. Tile branding (32x32 + 80x80 VerseOps mark).",
